  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Department for International Development&apos;s (DFID) Support to Implementation of Uganda&apos;s National Development Plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the DFID-Bank Partnership for Support to the  Implementation of the Government of Uganda&apos;s National Development Plan  (the Partnership) is to address knowledge gaps and capacity  constraints through innovative partnership work on: i. the growth  agenda; ii. public sector reform; iii. poverty and inequality; and iv.  cross-cutting areas such as peace and recovery, population, gender etc.</narrative>
  </description>
